# ======================================================================
# scCausalRL — public release .gitignore
#
# This repository tracks ONLY the source code, configs, figure scripts,
# and manuscript behind the paper:
#   "Compositional Perturbation Planning with a Generative Structural
#    Causal World Model" (NeurIPS 2026 workshop).
#
# Large binaries (checkpoints, datasets, result dumps), legacy precursor
# experiments, abandoned model arms, and internal working notes are left
# on disk but intentionally NOT tracked. See README.md "Repository layout".
# ======================================================================

# ----- Python -----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ----- Environments -----
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.env

# ----- IDE / OS -----
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ======================================================================
# Large binaries — never tracked anywhere in the tree
# ======================================================================
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.npy
*.npz
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.h5ad
*.zarr
*.arrow
*.parquet
*.feather
*.mtx
*.mtx.gz
*.bam
*.fasta
*.fa
*.rds
*.RDS
*.csv
*.tsv

